# Vela — Python scanners (scripts/), Svelte frontend source (web/), and the
# frontend build output that is deliberately COMMITTED into globe/.
#
# Keep this file small and scoped. Bare directory patterns like `lib/`, `dist/`
# or `build/` match at EVERY depth, not just the repo root — an inherited
# `lib/` rule once silently untracked web/src/lib/ even though the files built
# fine locally. Prefer anchored paths (web/dist/) over bare names.

# --- Secrets & credentials (never commit) ---
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.envrc
*.pem
*.key
secrets.*
*.local

# --- Python (scripts/) ---
__pycache__/
*.py[codz]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# --- Node / Svelte frontend (web/) ---
# Anchored on purpose: globe/app/** is BUILT OUTPUT that must stay tracked,
# and web/ keeps its own .gitignore for tooling that reads it locally.
node_modules/
web/dist/

# --- Generated output ---
digest.md
*.log

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Claude / agent dev tooling (local context, not for the public repo) ---
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
